cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use KernelScope in authorized research, education, or a publication,
  please cite the software using this metadata.
title: KernelScope
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hitay
    given-names: Ahmet Yusuf
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  KernelScope is a defensive Windows kernel telemetry and driver integrity
  platform combining a KMDF control driver, a C++ collector, a bounds-checked
  PE/COFF analyzer, SHA-256 hashing, Authenticode verification, structured JSON
  reporting, and automated tests.
keywords:
  - Windows
  - KMDF
  - kernel telemetry
  - driver integrity
  - PE/COFF
  - defensive security
